        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kanaan ramthan nzuan khang tei",
            "Zinghpui ram khou ginne,",
            "Kagan rina achaeng maan the",
            "Mai le muang rui gaan guang o;",
            "Ahu khou hei guanga gaan o.",
            "",
            "He! Kanloumeipu ‘buinung houni cho?",
            "Kanaan ram tang mak khang lunggei;",
            "Rianra zinghmei muang ding khou,",
            "Achun sina kabma huai e.",
            "",
            "2. Nuan phungmei kandimei nun khang,",
            "Ringhpui duithan patdiu;",
            "Kaniu nuan tei khiuthan lana,",
            "Kanloumeipu ta hou khang,",
            "Hei kandi ta ningdat mak khang.",
            "",
            "3. Ahu khou chingkhat gut kan the,",
            "Kanaan ramgai khou tei;",
            "Rianrapui ram ning datlak khe;",
            "Theihpui bam tuanpu khou rui",
            "Ringhpui namdaih tei nzuanni.",
            "",
            "4. Tingkao gaanphiu gaanpui ram khou,",
            "Kanloumeipu’ thuanni,",
            "Kandi rianra’ maanlou puni,",
            "Neihlapui lu than suanni;",
            "Khou tei bam khang ai neihlaa e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
